ongrass]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Grater|grated]] [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]] root\n* 6 red [[Cookbook:Chiles|chilli peppers]], seeded and chopped\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 3 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], smashed\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Shallot|shallot]], chopped\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Terasi|trassi]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Toasting|Toast]] the cumin and coriander seeds in a pan for 3–4 minutes. Set aside.\n# Grind lemongrass and ginger in a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar]], add chilli-peppers and salt, and grind for 4 minutes.\n# Add garlic and shallot and keep grinding.\n# Add the roasted cumin and coriander seeds and turmeric. \n# Add the trassi and grind to a fluid paste.\n# Store in an airtight container in the refrigerator for storage (lasts 1 month).\n\n[[Category:Thai recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for curry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coriander]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cumin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using shallot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using turmeric]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemongrass]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Yellow Curry Paste","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 tablespoons coriander seed","sourceText":"2 tablespoons coriander seed","amountText":"2 tablespoons coriander seed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tablespoons cumin seed","sourceText":"2 tablespoons cumin seed","amountText":"2 tablespoons cumin seed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 branches lemongrass, chopped","sourceText":"3 branches lemongrass, chopped","amountText":"3 branches lemongrass, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tablespoon grated ginge